FICER-Surv
Public inference implementation: TabPFN-FICER-Surv
Built with PriorLabs-TabPFN

FICER-Surv uses the official TabPFN 8.2.0 implementation through an installed
Python dependency. TabPFNClassifier and ModelVersion.V3 in ficer_surv/tcsi.py
are provided by Prior Labs and the TabPFN contributors. Their implementation
is used for frozen tabular inference. The TabPFN source tree and pretrained
weights are not distributed in this repository. FICER-Surv adds molecular
evidence construction and a task-specific survival interface; it does not
modify or retrain the upstream TabPFN backbone or its pretrained weights.

